description:
Joint application for the works at 72 &amp; 74 The Charter Road. 
Replacement of porch and replacement roofs to garage, side utility room, along with a new raised verandah with new associated boundary treatments to 72 The 
Charter Road.&nbsp;Construction of a replacement single storey wraparound rear extension along with new raised patio and replacement staircase at 74 The Charter Road. Associated works to both properties to include new fencing, party wall, retaining wall.&nbsp;
